# Override the root .gitignore's `*.bin`, `*.fw`, `*.csp`, `*.dsp` rules
# for everything under firmware/. Droidian's kernel-deb embeds firmware
# blobs into the kernel image via CONFIG_EXTRA_FIRMWARE, so these have
# to ship in-tree. Upstream Linux ignores them on the assumption that
# /lib/firmware will provide them at runtime — that's not our model.
!*.bin
!*.fw
!*.csp
!*.dsp

# Still ignore generated artefacts (assembly source from binary blobs
# and the host helper) — produced during build, never committed.
*.gen.S
ihex2fw
